	default n
	depends on CDK2_CONSOLE
	help
	  Append CDK2 diagnostics to the console buffer published by coreboot.
	  This sink is independent of the UEFI serial driver; debug builds may
	  tee the same records to their early serial transport.

config CDK2_SPI_CONSOLE
