	int "Optional USB media discovery timeout in seconds"
	range 0 60
	default 2
	depends on CDK2_PAYLOAD
	help
	  Bound optional USB mass-storage discovery.  Already discovered media
	  remains usable; zero disables the deadline.  This is separate from the
	  boot-menu timeout, which applies only after device discovery.

